        "Content": "4 bedroom detached house which was well maintained by its owner occupants.\r\n\r\nLocated within the village centre within a housing estate of only 5 houses.\r\n\r\nLarge house which is has been consistently well maintained since it was built.\r\n\r\nThe eircode for directions is A82XD30."
      },
